# Example: construction_arrays.wcn

## Schema

```
School = [Person]/students
Person = String/name
```

## Construction

```
[:School [:Array/Person [:Person "John"] [:Person "Jane"]]] 
```

## Target

```
%terminal

%main
public static function main():Void {
    var school = SchoolAssemblage.factory();
    var helper = new WCHNTHelper();
    trace(school.toConstruction(0, helper));
}
```
